'ID' (indexed keywords), 'SO' (source), 'PY' (year), 'DI' (DOI),
'TI' (title), and 'SR' (a short label);
\item \code{openalexR::oa_fetch()}, a data frame of works with the columns
'id', 'display_name', 'authorships' (or 'author'), 'publication_year',
